,87.37265008748562,87.4099250765584,87.41407011652122,87.38506901110922,87.32303507879212,87.22821070999582,87.10096641998913,86.94179940113875,86.7513315801874,86.53030718814665,86.27958985230036,86.00015922168092,85.69310713920375,85.35963337541703,85.0010409405371,84.61873099308634,84.21419736502827,83.78902072479147,83.34486240099048,82.88345789097592,82.40661007957921,81.91618219454821,81.41409052620003,80.90229693973788,80.38280120948954,79.85763320502006,79.32884495965078,78.7985026523763,78.2686785345086,77.74144283259432,77.21885565924386,76.70295896347906,76.19576855205337,75.69926621291974,75.21539197162305,74.7460365108745,74.29303378292715,73.85815384361926,73.44309593608584,73.04948185116201,72.67884959042273,72.33264735661949,72.01222789499496,71.71884320758754,71.4536396611778,71.21765350799286,71.01180683667005,70.83690396930275,70.69362831864413,70.58253971775102,70.50407223250085,70.4585324655294,70.44609835821629,70.46681849539974,70.52061191553685,70.60726842705147,70.72644942963359,70.87768923728082,71.06039689791281,71.27385850244798,71.51723997432114,71.78959032854121,72.08984538755499,72.41683193939842,72.76927232188658,73.1457894149312,73.54491202147837,73.96508061604106,74.40465343836479,74.86191290841627,75.33507233762917,75.82228291018279,76.32164090703712,76.8311951444945,77.34895459822467,77.87289618296266,78.4009726574806],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"#d62728\",\"width\":2},\"name\":\"n = 4\"},{\"x\":[0.0,0.0,1.0,1.0],\"y\":[90.0,0.0,0.0,90.0],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"black\",\"width\":3},\"name\":\"V(x)\"}],\"layout\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"Infinite Square Well: Levels and Wavefunctions\"},\"width\":700,\"height\":450,\"plot_bgcolor\":\"white\",\"paper_bgcolor\":\"white\",\"xaxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"x\"},\"range\":[-0.1,1.1],\"gridcolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linecolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linewidth\":1,\"zerolinecolor\":\"black\",\"zerolinewidth\":1},\"yaxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"E, and ψ offset by E\"},\"range\":[-2.0,90.0],\"gridcolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linecolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linewidth\":1,\"zerolinecolor\":\"black\",\"zerolinewidth\":1}}}"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "display_data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Harmonic Oscillator [S+N]\n\nFor $V = x^2/2$ the exact states are $\\psi_n(x) = H_n(x)\\,e^{-x^2/2}/\\sqrt{2^n n!\\sqrt\\pi}$, with $H_n$ the Hermite polynomials from `orthopoly`, and $E_n = n + 1/2$. Substituting the first six into the Schrödinger equation leaves zero residual, and each integrates to one.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "psi_ho(n, x) := hermite(n, x)*exp(-x^2/2)/sqrt(2^n*n!*sqrt(%pi))$\nresiduals : makelist(ratsimp(-diff(psi_ho(j, x), x, 2)/2 + x^2/2*psi_ho(j, x)\n                             - (j + 1/2)*psi_ho(j, x)), j, 0, 5)$\nnorms : makelist(integrate(psi_ho(j, x)^2, x, minf, inf), j, 0, 5)$\n['residuals = residuals, 'norms = norms];",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 10,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
            "text/latex": [
              "\\left[ {\\it residuals}=\\left[ 0 , 0 , 0 , 0 , 0 , 0 \\right]  , {\\it norms}= \\left[ 1 , 1 , 1 , 1 , 1 , 1 \\right]  \\right] "
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 10,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "The matrix uses 400 points on $[-8, 8]$. The wavefunctions decay like $e^{-x^2/2}$, so the hard walls at $\\pm 8$ have no visible effect on the low states.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "[h_ho, x_ho] : grid(-8, 8, 400)$\nV_ho : x_ho^2/2$\n[E_ho, v_ho] : eig_lowest(fd_hamiltonian(h_ho, V_ho), 6)$\nprintf(true, \" n   exact   matrix E     rel. error~%\")$\nfor j : 1 thru 6 do\n  printf(true, \"~2d ~7,2f ~11,6f ~12,3e~%\", j - 1, j - 0.5, E_ho[j], (E_ho[j] - (j - 0.5))/(j - 0.5))$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 11,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            " n   exact   matrix E     rel. error\n 0    0.50    0.499950    -9.951e-5\n 1    1.50    1.499751    -1.659e-4\n 2    2.50    2.499353    -2.588e-4\n 3    3.50    3.498756    -3.555e-4\n 4    4.50    4.497959    -4.535e-4\n 5    5.50    5.496964    -5.521e-4"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "Normalising each eigenvector and aligning its sign with the exact $\\psi_n$ makes the two directly comparable. The largest pointwise difference measures the agreement of the wavefunctions; in the figure the dashed black curves are exact and the coloured ones numeric.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "psi_ho_ex : makelist(makelist(float(psi_ho(j - 1, xv)), xv, x_ho), j, 1, 5)$\npsi_ho_fd : makelist(align_sign(v_ho[j]/sqrt(h_ho), psi_ho_ex[j]), j, 1, 5)$\nfor j : 1 thru 5 do\n  printf(true, \"n = ~d: max |psi_matrix - psi_exact| = ~,2e~%\", j - 1,\n         lmax(map(abs, psi_ho_fd[j] - psi_ho_ex[j])))$\n\nn_first : 0$\ninside_ho : sublist_indices(x_ho, lambda([xv], abs(xv) <= 4.5))$\nxs_plot : makelist(x_ho[i], i, inside_ho)$\nax_draw2d(\n  level_objects(xs_plot, makelist(V_ho[i], i, inside_ho), firstn(E_ho, 5),\n                makelist(makelist(psi_ho_fd[j][i], i, inside_ho), j, 1, 5), 0.6),\n  makelist(lines(xs_plot, (j - 0.5) + 0.6*makelist(psi_ho_ex[j][i], i, inside_ho),\n                 color = \"black\", dash = \"dash\", line_width = 1, showlegend = false), j, 1, 5),\n  lines(xs_plot, makelist(V_ho[i], i, inside_ho), color = \"black\", dash = \"solid\",\n        line_width = 3, name = \"V(x)\"),\n  title = \"Harmonic Oscillator: Matrix (colour) and Exact (dashed)\",\n  xlabel = \"x\", ylabel = \"E, and ψ offset by E\", yrange = [0, 5.5])$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 12,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "n = 0: max |psi_matrix - psi_exact| = 4.70e-5\nn = 1: max |psi_matrix - psi_exact| = 1.23e-4\nn = 2: max |psi_matrix - psi_exact| = 2.50e-4\nn = 3: max |psi_matrix - psi_exact| = 4.56e-4\nn = 4: max |psi_matrix - psi_exact| = 7.25e-4"
          ]
        },
